## filterpanel widget — verified from production org

For Data Cloud (DLM) datasets, use `cdpObject` + `dataspace`:

```json
"filterpanel_1": {
  "type": "filterpanel",
  "parameters": {
    "showAllFilters": false,
    "filterItemOptions": {
      "propertyColor": "#54698D",
      "valueColor": "#16325C"
    },
    "filters": [
      {
        "field": "CategoryLabel__c",
        "cdpObject": "accrualoutput_decorated__dlm",
        "dataspace": "default"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

For standard CRMA datasets (non-Data Cloud), use `dataset` instead of `cdpObject`:

```json
"filters": [
  { "field": "StageName", "dataset": "opportunity" }
]
```

