## text widget — verified richTextContent shape

```json
"text_1": {
  "type": "text",
  "parameters": {
    "showActionMenu": true,
    "interactions": [],
    "content": {
      "richTextContent": [
        {
          "insert": "Note: This dashboard requires a successful accrual calculation.",
          "attributes": { "bold": true, "size": "16px", "color": "#e74340" }
        },
        {
          "insert": "\n",
          "attributes": { "align": "left" }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

NEVER use `"text": "..."` — CRMA requires the `richTextContent` array format.
Each segment is `{ "insert": "text", "attributes": { style props } }`.
Always end with a newline segment `{ "insert": "\n", "attributes": { "align": "left" } }`.

