## cdpObjects vs datasets — when to use which

| Dataset type | Step field to use | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Data Cloud (DLM) object | `cdpObjects: ["name__dlm"]` + `datasets: []` + `dataspace: "default"` | `"cdpObjects": ["accrualoutput_decorated__dlm"]` |
| Standard CRMA dataset | `datasets: [{ "id": "...", "name": "...", "url": "..." }]` + no cdpObjects | `"datasets": [{ "id": "0FbB...", "name": "opportunity" }]` |

If you don't know which type the org uses, call get-dataset-fields or list-dashboards and check
an existing dashboard's step definition.
